{%- comment -%}
  Besjaar — temporary promotional campaign (Nationale Kraanwaterdag 2026)

  Renders the campaign banner and the product-page campaign block for
  "BESJAAR WATER WEEK 💧", 21–30 September 2026.

  HOW THE CAMPAIGN IS TIED TO A REAL SHOPIFY DISCOUNT
  ---------------------------------------------------
  The campaign never claims a discount on its own. It is configured in the same
  shop metafield as the discount mirror (`besjaar_discounts.active`), and
  `campaign.discount_id` points at one specific automatic Shopify discount that
  tools/sync-shopify-discounts.mjs resolved by title. Nothing renders unless ALL
  of these hold, re-checked on every request:

    1. the mirror is present, enabled and fresh;
    2. the campaign is enabled and was successfully linked to a discount;
    3. now is inside the campaign window (21 Sept – 30 Sept 2026, Amsterdam);
    4. that exact discount is still in the mirror and inside its OWN window.

  Pause or delete the discount in Shopify and re-sync, and the campaign goes
  dark. Let the discount's own end date pass and it goes dark with no sync at
  all. The percentage shown is always the discount's real value, never a
  hard-coded 15.

  PARAMETERS
    layout   'banner'  — the site-wide promotional bar (default)
             'product' — the block for the product page buy box
    product  required for layout 'product'; the block only renders when this
             product is actually covered by the campaign discount
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign bjc_layout = layout | default: 'banner'
  assign bjc_data = shop.metafields.besjaar_discounts.active.value
  assign bjc_campaign = bjc_data.campaign
  assign bjc_live = true

  unless bjc_data
    assign bjc_live = false
  endunless
  if bjc_data.enabled == false
    assign bjc_live = false
  endif
  unless bjc_campaign
    assign bjc_live = false
  endunless
  unless bjc_campaign.enabled == true
    assign bjc_live = false
  endunless
  unless bjc_campaign.linked == true
    assign bjc_live = false
  endunless

  assign bjc_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0

  comment
    Same staleness guard the discount badges use: stale data must not keep a
    campaign on air after the discount behind it is gone.
  endcomment
  if bjc_live
    assign bjc_max_age_days = bjc_data.max_age_days | default: 30
    if bjc_max_age_days > 0
      assign bjc_generated = bjc_data.generated_at | default: 0
      if bjc_generated == 0
        assign bjc_live = false
      else
        assign bjc_age = bjc_now | minus: bjc_generated
        assign bjc_max_age = bjc_max_age_days | times: 86400
        if bjc_age > bjc_max_age
          assign bjc_live = false
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif

  comment
    The campaign window itself. ends_at is the first second AFTER the campaign,
    so the last day is included and the banner disappears on its own.
  endcomment
  assign bjc_ends = 0
  if bjc_live
    assign bjc_starts = bjc_campaign.starts_at | default: 0
    assign bjc_ends = bjc_campaign.ends_at | default: 0
    if bjc_starts > bjc_now
      assign bjc_live = false
    endif
    if bjc_ends > 0
      if bjc_ends <= bjc_now
        assign bjc_live = false
      endif
    else
      assign bjc_live = false
    endif
  endif

  comment
    The linked Shopify discount must still be in the mirror and still running.
    This is what keeps the message honest without a sync.
  endcomment
  assign bjc_value = ''
  assign bjc_rule_found = false
  if bjc_live
    for bjc_rule in bjc_data.rules
      unless bjc_rule.id == bjc_campaign.discount_id
        continue
      endunless
      assign bjc_rule_starts = bjc_rule.starts_at | default: 0
      if bjc_rule_starts > bjc_now
        continue
      endif
      if bjc_rule.ends_at
        assign bjc_rule_ends = bjc_rule.ends_at | plus: 0
        if bjc_rule_ends <= bjc_now
          continue
        endif
      endif
      assign bjc_rule_found = true
      assign bjc_matched = bjc_rule
      break
    endfor
    unless bjc_rule_found
      assign bjc_live = false
    endunless
  endif

  if bjc_live
    capture bjc_value
      if bjc_matched.value_type == 'percentage'
        echo bjc_matched.percentage_label
      else
        echo bjc_matched.amount_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
      endif
    endcapture
    assign bjc_value = bjc_value | strip
  endif

  comment
    Campaign copy. The promotional line always carries the discount's real
    value, so changing the discount in Shopify changes the wording too.
  endcomment
  if bjc_live
    assign bjc_line = bjc_campaign.line_template | replace: '{value}', bjc_value
  endif

  comment
    The product block only appears on products the campaign discount covers.
  endcomment
  if bjc_live and bjc_layout == 'product'
    assign bjc_covered = false
    if bjc_matched.scope == 'all'
      assign bjc_covered = true
    else
      capture bjc_product_token
        echo '|'
        echo product.id
        echo '|'
      endcapture
      if bjc_matched.product_ids contains bjc_product_token
        assign bjc_covered = true
      endif
    endif
    unless bjc_covered
      assign bjc_live = false
    endunless
  endif

  comment
    The banner is aimed at shoppers in the Netherlands. An empty country list
    means "show everywhere". If the market country cannot be resolved — markets
    localization switched off, for instance — fall back to the request locale
    rather than silently dropping the campaign.
  endcomment
  if bjc_live and bjc_layout == 'banner'
    if bjc_campaign.countries != ''
      assign bjc_country = localization.country.iso_code
      if bjc_country
        capture bjc_country_token
          echo '|'
          echo bjc_country
          echo '|'
        endcapture
        unless bjc_campaign.countries contains bjc_country_token
          assign bjc_live = false
        endunless
      else
        assign bjc_locale = request.locale.iso_code | split: '-' | first | downcase
        unless bjc_locale == 'nl'
          assign bjc_live = false
        endunless
      endif
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if bjc_live -%}
  {%- if bjc_layout == 'product' -%}
    <aside class="bj-campaign bj-campaign--product" aria-label="{{ bjc_campaign.name | escape }}">
      <p class="bj-campaign__name">{{ bjc_campaign.name }}</p>
      <p class="bj-campaign__tagline">{{ bjc_campaign.tagline }}</p>
      <p class="bj-campaign__line">{{ bjc_line }}</p>
      {%- if bjc_campaign.countdown == true -%}
        <p class="bj-campaign__countdown" data-bj-countdown="{{ bjc_ends }}" data-bj-countdown-label="{{ bjc_campaign.countdown_label | escape }}" hidden></p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </aside>
  {%- else -%}
    <aside class="bj-campaign bj-campaign--banner" aria-label="{{ bjc_campaign.name | escape }}" data-bj-campaign-banner>
      <div class="bj-campaign__shell">
        <div class="bj-campaign__copy">
          <p class="bj-campaign__name">{{ bjc_campaign.name }}</p>
          <p class="bj-campaign__tagline">{{ bjc_campaign.tagline }}</p>
        </div>
        <p class="bj-campaign__line">{{ bjc_line }}</p>
        {%- if bjc_campaign.countdown == true -%}
          <p class="bj-campaign__countdown" data-bj-countdown="{{ bjc_ends }}" data-bj-countdown-label="{{ bjc_campaign.countdown_label | escape }}" hidden></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if bjc_campaign.cta_label != '' and bjc_campaign.cta_url != '' -%}
          {%- capture bjc_cta_url -%}{% render 'localized-internal-url', url: bjc_campaign.cta_url %}{%- endcapture -%}
          <a class="bj-campaign__cta" href="{{ bjc_cta_url | strip }}">{{ bjc_campaign.cta_label }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </aside>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
